          "url": "https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/employee-experience-foundation/employee-center-to-dos-page-configuration.html"
        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Preserve existing Grant My approvals queue and server scope; fix real overdue/current decision contradiction before cosmetic work."
    },
    {
